# World 2's radar sites and the jet zone rule (SPEC 11, "World 2, slice 2", slice A). Ctrl+L, W, 5 starts mission 5, Trade Winds,
# at the base pad; the skill is pinned to 5 after the world has loaded (the keys before it never leave world 1).
# - the card's strip map carries each jet zone as a red line (row 1) and each radar site as a tick;
# - the HUD radar's ground line is red (0xD42) under each live zone, stone (0x564) elsewhere, and the site is a white dot;
# - in the strait between the second and fourth island (x 2208-2816) no jet comes however long the chopper stays (ghost: nothing
#   hurts it); inside the second island's zone a jet is announced;
# - the radar site on that island falls to the cannon: "AGK radar down", its red bar leaves the HUD radar.
# The unit tests (tests/unit/test_logic.c, testW2Radar*, testW2JetsStartOnlyInsideALiveZone) hold the rules.
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x05
wait-serial "AGK world 2 loaded" 700
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x05
wait 30
screenshot card
expect-color card 130 21 0xD42
expect-color card 200 21 0xD42
expect-color card 80 21 0x564
expect-color card 240 21 0x564
expect-color card 122 121 0xD42
expect-color card 32 121 0x111
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x24
wait 30
press fire 2
wait 60
press up 60
press left 560
wait 20
screenshot strait
wait-serial "mission=1 x=24" 200
wait 700
screenshot hover
press left 150
wait-serial "jet warn" 400
screenshot warned
press left 60
wait 40
screenshot site
# the site stands on the island: its base is stone (0x998) with a cream edge (0xFEC) (a gust has pushed the chopper a few px: slice B)
expect-color site 80 235 0x998
expect-color site 82 237 0xFEC
hold fire
press down 70
wait-serial "radar down=" 200
release
wait 30
screenshot down
expect-color down 130 21 0x564
expect-color down 200 21 0xD42
expect-serial "AGK radar down=[01] radar zones=1"
# nothing was announced while the chopper sat in the strait (a jet warning before the last of its hover lines would be a failure)
expect-no-serial "jet warn[\s\S]*mission=1 x=2420 "
expect-no-serial "AGK ERR|missing"
expect-no-dropped-frames
expect-min-chip-free 96
